(Operations review) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Store network: Harbourline operated 12 stores at 30 June 2025, in New South Wales, Victoria,) Tj T*
(Queensland, South Australia, the Australian Capital Territory, and Tasmania. Braddon \(ACT\)) Tj T*
(opened in FY22 and remains the newest store.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Loyalty: Harbourline Rewards reached 412,000 active members, up from 368,000 a year earlier.) Tj T*
(Members generated 57% of sales revenue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Inventory: the out-of-stock rate averaged 2.4% across the year, inside the 3% target set in) Tj T*
(the replenishment policy. Shrink was 1.2% of sales, down from 1.4% in FY24.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(People: Harbourline employed 1,640 team members at year end, 38% of them full time.) Tj T*
